1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,635
Long ago, on Mount Kailash,

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,731
a golden fruit fell from the heavens.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,323
The fruit of all wisdom.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,307
But it could not be shared.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,232
And Shiva had two sons.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,322
Kartikeya, the swift, and Ganesha, the wise.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,141
Whoever circles the whole world three times first, wins the fruit.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,199
Kartikeya leapt onto his peacock, and was gone in a flash.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,355
Ganesha looked at his little mouse. And smiled.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,959
Over oceans. Over mountains. Across every land.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,165
Ganesha simply walked around his parents.

12
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,392
Once. Twice. Three times.

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,062
You are my whole world.

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,972
And the fruit was his.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,897
When Kartikeya returned, the race was already won.

16
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,690
That is why they say, the world is not out there.

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,213
It is the ones who made you.

18
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,928
Follow for more stories.
